  "rationales": {"U":"需求以疑问句形式'...will be activated automatically via the CPCC or by external human intervention?'呈现，违反需求应为陈述性、指令性语句的基本规范；读者无法确定这是约束、假设还是待确认问题，'Should...occur'和末尾问号共同导致理解意图模糊；证据片段：'Should a non-recoverable MCCC system failure occur, the backup MCCC system will be activated automatically via the CPCC or by external human intervention?'","A":"'or by external human intervention'引入模态歧义——该操作是备选路径（自动激活失败时才人工介入）？还是与自动激活并列的两种独立触发方式？'via the CPCC or by...'结构未定义逻辑关系（exclusive/inclusive OR）且未说明触发条件优先级；证据片段：'automatically via the CPCC or by external human intervention'","C":"需求隐含'CPCC能检测非可恢复故障并触发备份'这一技术前提，但未明确定义CPCC的功能边界与故障检测能力；若CPCC本身失效则无法执行自动激活，该场景未被覆盖，故功能完整性存疑；证据片段：'the backup MCCC system will be activated automatically via the CPCC'","V":"整个需求缺乏可测量的行为判定标准：未定义'non-recoverable MCCC system failure'的可观测判据（如连续心跳超时3次+诊断码0x8F）、未规定'activated'的具体验收信号（如备用系统输出状态寄存器bit[0]置1且持续≥100ms）、未明确'automatically'的时间上限（如≤500ms）；证据片段：'will be activated automatically'"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"The system shall activate the backup MCCC system within 500 ms of detecting a non-recoverable MCCC system failure.","A":"The system shall activate the backup MCCC system automatically via the CPCC upon confirmed detection of a non-recoverable MCCC system failure; if the CPCC fails to initiate activation within 500 ms, a human operator shall manually activate the backup MCCC system using the emergency override panel.","C":"The CPCC shall detect non-recoverable MCCC system failures by monitoring MCCC health signals (heartbeat, diagnostic register 0x2A, and voltage rail tolerance) and shall assert the 'backup_activation_request' signal when all three criteria are simultaneously violated for ≥200 ms.","V":"Upon occurrence of a non-recoverable MCCC system failure (defined as: MCCC heartbeat absent for ≥3 consecutive cycles AND diagnostic register 0x2A = 0x8F AND 12V rail < 10.5V for ≥100 ms), the backup MCCC system shall transition to ACTIVE state no later than 500 ms after the third violating condition is met, as verified by measurement of the 'backup_status' signal rising edge on pin J7.4."},
